abstract: >-
  A document-conversion platform with Web UI, REST API, and WeChat mini-program from a single Python backend. ~20 source/target pairs (PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, Markdown, HTML, images, data), batch up to 200 files, LibreOffice/Pandoc/Pillow/WeasyPrint/Tesseract backends, JWT auth with 2FA, S3/MinIO, webh
